<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<odoo>
    <record id='MetalWorksheet_large_20260303_form_view' model='ir.ui.view'>
        <field name="name">Metal.worksheet.large.20260303.form.view</field>
        <field
            name="model"
            model="ir.model"
            eval="obj().env.ref('impress_quality_worksheets.ws_metal_large_20260303').model_id.model"
        />
        <field name="priority">1</field>
        <field name="arch" type="xml">
            <form create="false" js_class="worksheet_validation">
                <sheet>
                    <group
                        invisible="context.get('studio') or context.get('default_x_quality_check_id')"
                    >
                        <group>
                            <field name="x_quality_check_id" />
                        </group>
                    </group>
                    <div>
                        <div>
                            <ul>
                                <li
                                >If the ejection of one of the indicators is non-compliant, call quality control, fill in a discrepency log, readjust the machine and test again all products since the last compliant validation.</li>
                                <li
                                >If there is a metal reject during production, call quality control.</li>
                                <li
                                >During the last check (end of production), check that no product is left in the reject bin.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <div style="font-weight: bold;">Frequency: </div>
                            <ul>
                                <li
                                >At the start and end of work shifts/production every day.</li>
                                <li
                                >At intervals of ≤2 hours producing continuously.</li>
                                <li>When changes happen in production lots.</li>
                                <li>When changes happen after machine adjustments.</li>
                                <li>After downtime following repairs.</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <ul>
                                <li
                                > Calibration : Compare the mass of a bottle with a table scale and the Loma, if the difference is of 2g et +, do a calibration. </li>
                                <li
                                > Filling: Compare the average mass of the bottles with the target weight. If the difference is of + / - 3g, adjust the filler. </li>
                                <li
                                > During the last verification, make sure that no product is present in the rejects bin</li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <field name="x_metal_log_line_ids" nolabel="1">
                        <form>
                            <group>
                                <group>
                                    <field name="calibration" required='1' />
                                    <field name="ejection" required='1' />
                                    <field name="reject_value" required='1' />
                                    <field name="mean_weight" required='1' />
                                    <field name="start_date" required='1' />
                                    <field name="notes" />
                                </group>
                                <group>
                                    <field
                                        name="ferrous_large"
                                        required='1'
                                        string="Ferrous (2.0 mm)"
                                    />
                                    <field
                                        name="non_ferrous_large"
                                        required='1'
                                        string="Non ferrous (3.0 mm)"
                                    />
                                    <field
                                        name="stainless_large"
                                        required='1'
                                        string="Stainless (4.0 mm)"
                                    />
                                    <field
                                        name="signature"
                                        widget="signature"
                                        options="{'size':[0,90]}"
                                        required='1'
                                    />
                                </group>
                            </group>
                        </form>
                    </field>
                    <div class="text-center">
                        <strong>Pour l'utilisation exclusive de Impress Foods</strong>
                        <strong> • </strong>
                        <strong>Mis à jour le 03 Mars 2026</strong>
                        <strong> • </strong>
                        <strong
                        >Feuille de contrôle Détecteur de Métal (Gros indicateurs)</strong>
                    </div>
                </sheet>
            </form>
        </field>
    </record>
</odoo>
